WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:05,290
Enemy! Invasion! Enemy! Invasion!

2
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:08,598
Tang Lang

3
00:00:08,598 --> 00:00:13,560
It's you again

4
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:17,560
Don't be angry! If you turn around and make yourself angry, you won't be able to lay eggs.

5
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,560
Then you are of no use.

6
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,560
Damn cousin, shameless thief

7
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:23,560
Your conscience won't hurt, right?

8
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,560
My conscience hurts so much

9
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,560
I'll eat more of your eggs later to make up for it.

10
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:31,863
Chase me

11
00:00:31,863 --> 00:00:44,770
It's about making a family pay the price
